WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.660
A forklift brakes just in time.

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.990
Did anyone report the near miss?

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:11.000
With ICC Safety, a worker can scan the QR
code posted at that crossing and

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.390
report what happened right from their
phone.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:17.170
There's no sign in, and leaving a name is
optional.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.620
The report goes straight to the safety
register with the location and a

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:25.980
reference number. The safety team can open
it, assign someone to

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.930
investigate, and track what gets done
about the blind corner.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:34.370
That gives your team a chance to act
before someone gets hurt.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.240
Book a safety demo with ISO Certification
Consultants.
